rms of game development and production, we set up a more professional game team, abandoned AI and used pure hand-drawn painting and a large number of story texts, so as to bring the majority of players the feeling of being in the scene.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally, thank you for your support in the production of Princess: The East and the Expedition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048660/extras/a18368f102c47d2422af8adfcd2a2c48.avif?t=1746774113\" width=590 height=190 /></span>Princess: The East and the Expedition is a &quot;Pretty girl +Roguelike+ real-time strategy&quot; game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an expedition general appointed by the emperor, you need to use your wisdom and courage to expand your territory in unknown countries and uncover the conspiracies hidden in the dark depths. During the period you will also meet a variety of different styles of beautiful girls, to help you on the road to battle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048660/extras/48437a4021b28873493b931339efa846.avif?t=1746774113\" width=590 height=190 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048660/extras/b4bbbfa9b9e9dc8bbff21419b9d54f40.avif?t=1746774113\" width=624 height=350 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048660/extras/a6049f90bfe3b4a67e071adb9e39cce9.avif?t=1746774113\" width=624 height=300 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048660/extras/80a46deb2252f4f622286542c1c96e80.avif?t=1746774113